        "eyebrow": "Chapter One — The Beginning",
        "heading": "Where Global Inspiration Meets the Pakistani Table",
        "text": "<p>The Home Palette started in 2024 with a simple ambition: to bring a level of ceramic tableware to Pakistan that had never been offered here before. At the time, finding truly handcrafted, A-grade ceramics with a premium finish meant looking beyond Pakistan. We saw a gap and decided to fill it.</p><p>Today, The Home Palette is built around bringing premium, beautifully crafted tableware closer to home. What began as an idea has grown into partnerships with multiple factories and workshops across the country, supported by trained artisans and an in-house design team. </p><p>Every day, our pieces make their way into thousands of homes, bringing colour, character, and considered design to the table.</p>",
        "quote": "A table should look like the people who set it. Warm, colourful, and entirely their own.",
        "sign_name": "The Home Palette",
        "sign_role": "Paradise Commercial, Bahria Town Phase 4",
        "button_label": "Browse Collections",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections"
      }
    },
    "hp_about_manifesto": {
      "type": "hp-about-manifesto",
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#fff9df",
        "center_head": true,
        "drop_cap": true,
        "eyebrow": "Chapter Two — Our Core Belief",
        "heading": "A Home Is Made in the Details",
        "lede": "<p>At The Home Palette, we believe that a beautiful home is created through the little details, the pieces you choose, the way you style them, and the moments you create around them.</p>",
        "body": "<p>The Home Palette is a pioneer in handcrafted, premium, and A-grade tableware in Pakistan, bringing together thoughtfully crafted ceramics, woven pieces, metalware, cutlery and wooden accessories, designed to add warmth, character and personality to your spaces.</p><p>But for us, it’s about more than just beautiful products. We’re passionate about supporting local women artisans and celebrating the craftsmanship behind every piece. From hand-finished ceramics to beautifully woven placemats, runners, tissue boxes and accessories, each piece represents skill, creativity, and the hands that bring it to life.</p><p>We believe beautiful tableware should also be made for real living. That’s why we focus on pieces that are safe, durable, functional and made to be enjoyed every day. Whether it’s a quiet breakfast at home, a dinner with loved ones, or a table set for a special celebration.</p><p>Today, The Home Palette is loved not only by individuals and families, but also by hotels and restaurants across Pakistan, who choose our pieces to bring a distinctive touch to their spaces and tables.</p><p>From everyday homes to hospitality spaces, we’re proud to be a part of the places where people gather, connect, celebrate and create memories.</p>",
        "quote_lead": "Because we don’t just want to decorate your table",
        "quote": "We want to make every tablescape a moment.",
        "button_label": "Shop the Collections",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections",
        "button_2_label": "For Hospitality",
        "button_2_link": "/pages/hospitality"
      }
    },
    "hp_about_process": {
      "type": "hp-about-process",
      "blocks": {
        "step_1": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/thp-workshop-bowls-drying.jpg",
            "title": "Sourcing & Craftsmanship",
            "text": "Every piece begins with A-grade ceramic materials and the skilled hands of trained artisans. We work with trusted workshops across Pakistan to create handcrafted tableware with the premium finish and consistency we believe every table deserves.",
            "caption": "Greenware on the workshop racks",
            "meta": "",
            "meta_icon": "leaf"
          }
        },
        "step_2": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/thp-workshop-plates-drying.jpg",
            "title": "Shaping & Casting",
            "text": "Plates and bowls are carefully shaped on the wheel or formed in plaster moulds, then left to firm before each piece is finished by hand. This stage gives every piece its clean form, balanced proportions and polished finish.",
            "caption": "Cast plates firming up on plaster",
            "meta": "",
            "meta_icon": "ruler"
          }
        },
        "step_3": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/thp-workshop-platters-drying.jpg",
            "title": "The First Firing",
            "text": "Once shaped and dried, each piece undergoes its first firing, transforming the clay into a strong, porous form ready for glazing. Every piece is carefully inspected at this stage to ensure only those meeting our standards move forward.",
            "caption": "Waiting on the racks for the kiln",
            "meta": "",
            "meta_icon": "flame"
          }
        },
        "step_4": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsAppImage2026-09-01at6.29.53PM.jpg",
            "title": "Glaze & Coloring",
            "text": "This is where the palette comes to life. Each glaze is carefully mixed and checked against our established colour standards, ensuring the shades remain true and consistent across the collection. From Sage Green and Limone Yellow to Reactive Cloud Grey, every colour is developed to work beautifully within the wider palette.",
            "caption": "Matched against the master tile",
            "meta": "",
            "meta_icon": "sparkles"
          }
        },
        "step_5": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/9EE8DEE8-7811-4B7B-99CE-E0E13C9D5E0C.jpg",
            "title": "Into the kiln",
            "text": "The final firing transforms each piece at high temperatures, setting the glaze into a durable, food-safe surface made for everyday use. It is a carefully controlled process that gives our tableware the strength and finish to become part of your everyday rituals.",
            "caption": "Twelve hours up, twelve hours down",
            "meta": "",
            "meta_icon": "flame"
          }
        },
        "step_6": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-04-19_at_7.42.31_PM_1.webp",
            "title": "Inspection & Packing",
            "text": "Every piece is carefully inspected, from its finish and form to its overall quality, before it becomes part of the collection. Only pieces that meet our standards are selected, carefully packed and prepared to make their way to your table.",
            "caption": "Wrapped, corner-blocked, double-boxed",
            "meta": "",
            "meta_icon": "shield-check"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "step_1",
        "step_2",
        "step_3",
        "step_4",
        "step_5",
        "step_6"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#1a4b46",
        "accent_color": "#7dc6bb",
        "flip": false,
        "center_head": true,
        "eyebrow": "Chapter Three — The Craftsmanship",
        "heading": "How a Collection Comes Together",
        "text": "Six stages, thoughtfully crafted and finished by hand. It may take longer than machine production, but that time is part of what makes our pieces special.",
        "foot_text": "Not every piece makes it to the end, and that is exactly how it should be. We take the time to select only what meets our standards, because we believe premium tableware is not just about how it looks, but about the care behind every piece you bring home.",
        "button_label": "See the Collections",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections"
      }
    },
